---
// src/pages/en/imprint.astro
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Operator from "../../components/Operator.astro";
import ExaliSeal from "../../components/ExaliSeal.astro";
import { company } from "../../data/config.ts";
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" page="imprint" title="Legal Notice">
  <h1>Legal Notice (Imprint)</h1>

  <section>
    <Operator lang="en" heading="Information pursuant to EU / German / Croatian Law" />

    <h3>German Operations (Classes & Local Services in Germany)</h3>
    <p>
      <strong>Provider / Operator:</strong> Studio Sun & Sea (Germany) - Sole Proprietorship / Einzelunternehmen<br />
      <strong>Owner & Operator:</strong> {company.director}<br />
      <strong>Address:</strong> {company.germanyAddress1}, {company.germanyAddress2}<br />
      <strong>Contact:</strong> {company.email} | {company.telDE}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Value Added Tax (VAT / USt / PDV)</h2>
    <h3>Studio Sun & Sea (Germany)</h3>
    <p>
      Studio Sun & Sea (Germany) is subject to the small business regulation pursuant to § 19 UStG (German VAT Act). No value added tax is charged or displayed for services rendered directly under the German sole proprietorship (Einzelunternehmen).
    </p>
    <h3>Eirene Intentio Citta d.o.o. (Croatia)</h3>
    <p>
      Eirene Intentio Citta d.o.o. is registered in the Croatian VAT system (PDV ID / EU VAT Identification Number).
      <strong>VAT ID (PDV):</strong> {company.vat}
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Professional Liability Insurance</h2>
    <ExaliSeal />
    <p>
      Professional liability insurance is maintained with Markel Insurance SE, concluded via Exali AG.
      <strong>Policy Number:</strong> EX.MDL.93787
    </p>

    <h3>Insured Risks</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Financial Loss Insurance (FLI)</li>
      <li>General Liability Insurance (GLI)</li>
      <li>Product Liability Insurance</li>
      <li>Special clauses for yoga teachers (Exali 2021-02)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Insurance Sums</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>300,000 € for financial losses (triple aggregation)</li>
      <li>3,000,000 € lump sum for personal injuries and property damage (triple aggregation)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Territorial Scope</h3>
    <p>The professional liability insurance offers coverage for insured activities worldwide, subject to the conditions and exclusions of the policy. Only the primary (German-language) policy document is legally binding.</p>

    <h3>Claims Reporting Address</h3>
    <p>
      Exali AG<br />
      Franz-Kobinger-Str. 9<br />
      86157 Augsburg, Germany<br />
      Phone: +49 (0) 821 80 99 46-0
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Legal Disclaimers (EU / Croatia / Germany)</h2>
    <p>As service providers, Studio Sun & Sea and Eirene Intentio Citta d.o.o. are responsible for their own content on these web pages under general statutory laws. Service providers are not obligated to monitor transmitted or stored third-party information or to investigate circumstances indicating illegal activity.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Liability for External Links</h2>
    <p>Our website contains links to external third-party websites over whose content we have no control. Therefore, we cannot accept any liability for this external content. The respective provider or operator of the pages is always responsible for the content of the linked pages.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Copyright</h2>
    <p>The content and works created by the site operator on these pages are subject to applicable copyright laws. Duplication, processing, distribution, or any form of utilization outside the limits of copyright law require the prior written consent of the respective author or creator.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Online Dispute Resolution (EU)</h2>
    <p>The European Commission provides a platform for online dispute resolution (ODR), accessible at: <a href="https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">https://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr</a>. Studio Sun & Sea / Eirene Intentio Citta d.o.o. is neither obligated nor willing to participate in dispute resolution proceedings before a consumer arbitration board.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Information for International Participants (USA)</h2>

    <h3>No Medical Advice</h3>
    <p>All services and contents are intended solely for general wellness promotion and educational purposes. No medical, therapeutic, or clinical services are provided. The information provided is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.</p>

    <h3>Personal Responsibility and Assumption of Risk</h3>
    <p>Yoga and physical movement involve inherent physical risks, including muscle strains, physical exertion, slips, and falls. By participating in our services, you explicitly acknowledge these risks and assume full personal responsibility for your safety.</p>

    <h3>Limitation of Liability</h3>
    <p>Neither Studio Sun & Sea nor Eirene Intentio Citta d.o.o. shall be liable for injuries, damages, or losses arising from participation in courses, workshops, or online sessions, to the maximum extent permitted by applicable local laws.</p>

    <h3>Participant Responsibility</h3>
    <p>Participants are solely responsible for monitoring their physical condition during practice and ensuring a safe training environment.</p>

    <h3>No Guarantee of Results</h3>
    <p>No specific outcome, health milestone, or physical progress is guaranteed or warranted through participation in these programs.</p>

    <h3>Safety in Online Classes</h3>
    <p>For online courses, participants are solely responsible for setting up a safe practice environment, including clearing adequate physical space, removing hazardous obstacles, and verifying stable camera and screen setups.</p>
  </section>

  <p>
    For comprehensive international tracking and liability details, please view our full
    <a href="/de/haftungsausschluss">German Declaration of Consent</a> and the
    <a href="/en/waiver">English Release and Waiver of Liability</a>.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
